# Docker Desktop on Windows creates these when a bind-mount path is mangled by
# Git Bash MSYS path conversion (":" separators become ";C:\..."). Empty and useless.
# Prevent them by prefixing a hand-typed `docker run -v` with MSYS_NO_PATHCONV=1,
# per CLAUDE.md §5 — the local stack itself is ./scripts/local.sh, which is Git Bash.
*;C
*;C/
